è davvero fuffosa!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aman!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sana {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}bureom'u{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} henüz
