{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Küçük {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Daeboreum hediyelerini{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
